From aa810712562e63702341138a2ef7e3f4aa803e95 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alessandro Fontana <alessandro.fontana@pm.me>
Date: Thu, 10 Sep 2026 10:51:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] drm/panel: himax-hx8279: correct the gtaxl GOA timing against
 the vendor table

The vendor init table for this panel writes exactly seven registers on
page 3: C5=2C, DE=2C, CA=42, D6=88, D7=08, D2=06, D3=06. Three of those
are programmed differently here.

C5 is GOA_TO(3) and DE is GOA_TE(1), so the odd and even timing arrays
in the panel description are the vendor's two values surrounded by
zeroes - but they hold 42 decimal, which is 0x2a, not the 0x2c the
vendor writes: both gate timings are two units short, and the value
looks like a hex figure transcribed as if it were decimal. CA holds the
dummy vblank count, written as three where the vendor asks for two.

Gate timing is what draws alternate lines, and this panel comes back
from a short screen off with horizontal stripes at line pitch on roughly
one wake-up in ten. Rewriting the whole init table on a striped panel
makes them fainter but does not clear them, while a power cycle always
does, which is consistent with the values being wrong rather than lost.

Use the vendor values, written in hex so they can be compared with the
table at a glance. D2, D3, D6 and D7 are still not programmed at all,
and C8, C9, CB, E4, E5 and E7 are written although the vendor never
touches them; those are left alone here.
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-himax-hx8279.c | 6 +++---
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-himax-hx8279.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-himax-hx8279.c
index 82df51937f..b84980f110 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-himax-hx8279.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-himax-hx8279.c
@@ -1910,11 +1910,11 @@ static const struct hx8279_panel_desc boe_hx8279d_gtaxl = {
 	.gmux = &boe_hx8279d_gtaxl_gmux,
 
 	/* Gate driver On Array (GOA) Configuration */
-	.goa_odd_timing = { 0, 0, 0, 42, 0, 0 },
-	.goa_even_timing = { 0, 42, 0, 0, 0, 0 },
+	.goa_odd_timing = { 0, 0, 0, 0x2c, 0, 0 },
+	.goa_even_timing = { 0, 0x2c, 0, 0, 0, 0 },
 	.goa_stv_lead_time_ck = 11,
 	.goa_ckv_lead_time_ck = 7,
-	.goa_ckv_dummy_vblank_num = 3,
+	.goa_ckv_dummy_vblank_num = 2,
 	.goa_ckv_rise_precharge = 40,
 	.goa_clr_polarity = { -1, -1, -1, -1 },
 	.goa_clr_start_pos = { -1, -1, -1, -1 },
-- 
2.47.3

